smart.error.invalid = Isha dhexgalka ah ee Shayga Caqli leh ma shaqaynayso.
smart.error.unsupported = Qaabka ishan looma isticmaali karo Shay Caqli leh ahaan.
smart.error.locked = Fur dhammaan nuqullada isha ka hor inta aanad cusboonaysiin.
smart.error.select = Dooro Lakab Shay Caqli leh oo aan qufulnayn.
smart.error.browser_link = Xidhiidhada nidaamka faylasha waxa laga heli karaa abka desktop-ka. Browser-ka ku isticmaal Shay Caqli leh oo la dhexgeliyey.
smart.error.changed = Bartilmaameedku wuu is beddelay intii la tafatirayay ama la soo dejinayay. Dib u fur nuxurka ama mar kale dooro isha.
smart.error.no_link = Shaygan Caqli leh ma laha xidhiidhiye fayl. Isticmaal Dib ugu Xidh si aad u doorato isha.
smart.error.nesting = Xidh tabka nuxurka ka hor inta aanad furin il kale oo ku dhex jirta.
smart.error.parent_closed = Dukumeentiga waalidka waa la xidhay. Isticmaal U Kaydi Sida si aad u haysato dukumeentigan nuxurka.
smart.error.file_changed = Faylka ku xidhan ayaa lagu beddelay meel ka baxsan Schist. Isticmaal U Kaydi Sida si aad u haysato tafatirkaaga, dabadeed isticmaal Dib ugu Xidh ama Cusboonaysii Nuqullada Ku Xidhan.
